.SH DIAGNOSTICS
Script exceptions and unhandled promise rejections print a stack trace and
produce a failing exit status. An unresolved top-level await is an error.
.SH BUGS
This is a subset of raylib. There are no browser, Node.js, std or os modules,
timers, workers, dynamic C modules or asynchronous I/O.
Promise jobs run after the main script returns; a synchronous rendering loop
does not dispatch them. Modules are limited to 16 MiB each.
Only one window/context is supported. Native graphics errors may terminate
the process; rayjs is not a sandbox. See raylib(2) for backend limitations.
